    "public_preview": null,
    "text": "Leave a 💛 below if any of these resonated. ✨ We’re living through heavy times. In a world that feels loud, uncertain, and increasingly disconnected, intimacy becomes an anchor. A reminder that it still exists; in friendship, in forgiveness, in softness, in choosing each other anyway. Notice the small things. Those moments matter more than ever.\n\nFor more daily healing at your fingertips, get a copy of our debut book now @ wetheurban.com. More in our bio. 🫶🏽\n\nwords: @williegreene_",
